# Copy to terraform.tfvars (gitignored) and fill in. Atlas credentials are NOT here — see
# infra/README.md for the MONGODB_ATLAS_PUBLIC_KEY / MONGODB_ATLAS_PRIVATE_KEY env vars instead.

